WEBVTT

00:00:06.237 --> 00:00:07.957
Nemo.

00:00:08.037 --> 00:00:10.037
-Oh, my goodness.
-Gotcha!

00:00:11.397 --> 00:00:13.557
-MARLIN: Nemo!
-Daddy?

00:00:14.397 --> 00:00:17.037
SHERMAN: Out with you. And stay out!

00:00:17.637 --> 00:00:20.357
-Daddy?
-Fishy?

00:00:21.157 --> 00:00:22.237
Fishy!

00:00:22.317 --> 00:00:24.037
Wake up! Wake up!

00:00:24.117 --> 00:00:25.637
-Oh, no!
-To the top

00:00:25.717 --> 00:00:27.237
of Mount Wannahockaloogie.

00:00:27.317 --> 00:00:29.637
Why are you sleeping?

00:00:29.917 --> 00:00:32.117
-Hurry!
-Bloat!

00:00:35.317 --> 00:00:37.237
Ring of Fire!

00:00:39.157 --> 00:00:40.557
Fishy!

00:00:42.797 --> 00:00:44.437
-DARLA: Get it out!
-Crikey!

00:00:44.517 --> 00:00:46.197
The animals have gone mad!

00:00:48.157 --> 00:00:50.317
DARLA: (SCREAMS) Get it out!

00:00:50.397 --> 00:00:52.357
-Smack her in the head!
-Go, Gill, go!

00:00:52.437 --> 00:00:54.397
There's a fish in my hair!

00:00:55.237 --> 00:00:57.237
-Gill.
-Sharkbait.

00:00:57.317 --> 00:01:00.157
Tell your dad I said hi.

00:01:04.437 --> 00:01:05.437
Aaggh!

00:01:05.557 --> 00:01:07.317
-Go get him.
-(SHERMAN GROANS)

00:01:11.917 --> 00:01:13.317
He did it!

00:01:14.197 --> 00:01:16.277
-I'm happy.
-Is he going to be okay?

00:01:16.397 --> 00:01:19.237
Don't worry.
All drains lead to the ocean.

00:01:19.317 --> 00:01:20.717
Fishy!

00:01:23.157 --> 00:01:24.357
Aaggh!

00:01:28.677 --> 00:01:30.277
Daddy!

00:01:32.917 --> 00:01:33.997
(GASPS)

00:02:06.637 --> 00:02:08.677
I'm... I'm so sorry.

00:02:10.397 --> 00:02:11.877
Truly I am.

00:02:30.077 --> 00:02:31.597
-Hey...
-Dory.

00:02:32.837 --> 00:02:36.677
If it wasn't for you,
I never would have even made it here.

00:02:37.597 --> 00:02:39.037
So thank you.

00:02:41.237 --> 00:02:42.757
Hey, wait a minute.

00:02:43.157 --> 00:02:45.597
Wait. Where are you going?

00:02:45.677 --> 00:02:48.557
It's over, Dory. We were too late.

00:02:50.197 --> 00:02:52.037
Nemo's gone.

00:02:52.117 --> 00:02:54.037
I'm going home now.

00:02:54.117 --> 00:02:56.237
No. No, you can't.

00:02:58.157 --> 00:02:59.317
Stop!

00:03:02.277 --> 00:03:04.557
Please don't go away. Please?

00:03:05.957 --> 00:03:08.037
No one's ever stuck with me
for so long before.

00:03:08.717 --> 00:03:10.957
And if you leave...

00:03:11.757 --> 00:03:14.557
I remember things better with you.
Look.

00:03:14.637 --> 00:03:16.837
P. Sherman, 42...

00:03:17.917 --> 00:03:19.637
42...

00:03:20.037 --> 00:03:23.357
Bah! I remember it. It's there. I know it is.

00:03:23.437 --> 00:03:25.997
Because when I look at you, I can feel it.

00:03:26.077 --> 00:03:28.437
And I look at you and I...

00:03:30.037 --> 00:03:31.477
I'm home.

00:03:34.157 --> 00:03:37.357
Please. I don't want that to go away.

00:03:38.477 --> 00:03:40.357
I don't want to forget.

00:03:41.957 --> 00:03:43.997
I'm sorry, Dory,

00:03:44.077 --> 00:03:45.517
but I do.

00:03:57.477 --> 00:04:00.797
-Manna from heaven.
-Sweet nectar of life.

00:04:01.397 --> 00:04:03.037
Hey!

00:04:03.117 --> 00:04:06.037
-This is our spot.
-Go on. Get out of here.

00:04:07.357 --> 00:04:09.917
Hey, hey, hey.

00:04:09.997 --> 00:04:11.677
Yeah, that's it.

00:04:12.837 --> 00:04:14.597
Too right, mate!

00:04:14.677 --> 00:04:16.277
I got a live one here!

00:04:16.357 --> 00:04:18.797
-Have you seen my dad?
-Gotcha!

00:04:18.917 --> 00:04:21.517
-Come back here.
-You let him go!

00:04:23.877 --> 00:04:25.277
Dad!

00:04:26.117 --> 00:04:27.717
Dad!

00:04:28.677 --> 00:04:29.957
Dad!

00:04:30.037 --> 00:04:31.357
DORY: No!

00:04:35.877 --> 00:04:37.397
(DORY GROANS)

00:04:44.277 --> 00:04:46.437
-Excuse me.
-No.

00:04:46.517 --> 00:04:48.917
-Are you all right?
-I don't know where I am.

00:04:48.997 --> 00:04:51.437
I don't know what's going on.
I think I lost somebody,

00:04:51.517 --> 00:04:53.237
but I can't remember.

00:04:53.317 --> 00:04:55.677
-It's okay.
-I can't remember.

00:04:55.757 --> 00:04:59.397
I'm looking for someone, too.
We can look together.

00:05:00.997 --> 00:05:02.957
-I'm Dory.
-I'm Nemo.

00:05:03.037 --> 00:05:04.477
Nemo?

00:05:05.117 --> 00:05:06.397
That's a nice name.

00:05:15.757 --> 00:05:17.557
-Dad!
-Dad!

00:05:17.637 --> 00:05:19.197
-Dad.
-Dad.

00:05:19.277 --> 00:05:20.877
Wait a minute. Is it your dad or my dad?

00:05:20.957 --> 00:05:22.077
My dad.

00:05:22.157 --> 00:05:24.117
-Got it. Dad!
-Where are we anyway?

00:05:24.197 --> 00:05:25.437
Dad!

00:05:26.277 --> 00:05:28.557
Syl... Schai...

00:05:28.637 --> 00:05:30.037
Sydney.

00:05:30.117 --> 00:05:32.757
P. Sherman, 42 Wallaby Way, Sydney.

00:05:34.517 --> 00:05:35.917
-Nemo!
-What?

00:05:35.997 --> 00:05:37.677
It's you! Nemo!

00:05:37.757 --> 00:05:39.357
Yes. I'm Nemo.

00:05:39.437 --> 00:05:42.197
You're Nemo.
You were dead. I saw you.

00:05:42.277 --> 00:05:44.637
And then... Here you are.
You're not dead.

00:05:44.717 --> 00:05:47.117
And your father... Your father!

00:05:47.197 --> 00:05:50.117
My father? You know my father?
Where is he?

00:05:50.197 --> 00:05:51.957
He went this way. Quick!

00:05:53.637 --> 00:05:54.677
Hey!

00:05:54.757 --> 00:05:56.717
Have you seen an orange fish swim by?

00:05:56.797 --> 00:05:58.797
-It looks like him.
-But bigger.

00:05:58.877 --> 00:06:01.597
I saw him,
but I'm not telling you where he went.

00:06:01.677 --> 00:06:05.117
And there's no way
you're going to make me.

00:06:07.677 --> 00:06:08.877
Mine.

00:06:08.957 --> 00:06:11.237
(SCREAMS) All right. I'll talk!

00:06:11.357 --> 00:06:13.877
He went to the fishing grounds.

00:06:18.837 --> 00:06:20.557
-Hey, look out.
-Sorry.

00:06:20.637 --> 00:06:22.437
I'm just trying to get home.

00:06:25.757 --> 00:06:27.157
(FAINT CRY) Daddy!

00:06:27.237 --> 00:06:29.997
-Nemo?
-NEMO: Daddy!

00:06:30.077 --> 00:06:31.157
Nemo?

00:06:31.237 --> 00:06:33.077
NEMO: Dad!
DORY: Nemo's alive!

00:06:33.157 --> 00:06:34.397
Dory?

00:06:34.477 --> 00:06:36.277
-Nemo!
-Daddy!

00:06:36.357 --> 00:06:39.757
-Nemo! I'm coming, Nemo!
-Dad!

00:06:39.837 --> 00:06:42.357
Nemo! Thank goodness.

00:06:42.997 --> 00:06:45.317
It's all right, son. It's going to be okay.

00:06:45.717 --> 00:06:48.157
Turn around!
You're going the wrong way.

00:06:50.997 --> 00:06:53.517
-Aaggh! Look out!
-Move!

